{"4654240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond The Blight", "steam_appid": 4654240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4812490], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're our last hope hero! Beyond the Blight is a <strong>2.5d</strong> <strong>first person, incremental dungeon-crawler </strong>that takes place in a dangerous land crawling with enemies<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to journey through the blighted forest as you <strong>loot, upgrade, and grow stronger</strong> on the quest eliminate the blight. <strong>Beat the boss before your health runs out</strong> and you succumb to the poisonous air. <strong>Choose your path, learn unique skills, and amass towering riches</strong> as you fight to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue to <strong>progress, explore, and loot</strong>, you will discover new opportunities to get stronger. With a large, <strong>extensive skill tree full</strong> of game-changing upgrades, you can choose unique skills and <strong>customize your path</strong> for future expeditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a <strong>multitude of different events and mini-games</strong> through your expeditions that, if performed correctly, will present you with <strong>amazing rewards!</strong> Make sure to master these events, because the blight eats at you with every failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/9c4ca5bad9551b9931fc9105f1b4d056.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/9c4ca5bad9551b9931fc9105f1b4d056.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/9c4ca5bad9551b9931fc9105f1b4d056.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blight is relentless and the enemies even more so! You'll have to explore a <strong>multitude of different biomes</strong>, defeat their <strong>unique monsters</strong>, and forge forward until you find the source of the blight.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're our last hope hero! Beyond the Blight is a <strong>2.5d</strong> <strong>first person, incremental dungeon-crawler </strong>that takes place in a dangerous land crawling with enemies<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/b0b08d6e47d9afc137282756d7173ff5.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to journey through the blighted forest as you <strong>loot, upgrade, and grow stronger</strong> on the quest eliminate the blight. <strong>Beat the boss before your health runs out</strong> and you succumb to the poisonous air. <strong>Choose your path, learn unique skills, and amass towering riches</strong> as you fight to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/dc702f70962add6926084efa5a7ea3d0.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue to <strong>progress, explore, and loot</strong>, you will discover new opportunities to get stronger. With a large, <strong>extensive skill tree full</strong> of game-changing upgrades, you can choose unique skills and <strong>customize your path</strong> for future expeditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.webm?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/119750b3d653a8df5b1ac82466986531.mp4?t=1785546342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a <strong>multitude of different events and mini-games</strong> through your expeditions that, if performed correctly, will present you with <strong>amazing rewards!</strong> Make sure to master these events, because the blight eats at you with every failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/9c4ca5bad9551b9931fc9105f1b4d056.poster.avif?t=1785546342\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654240/extras/9c4ca5bad9551b9931f